  "independent_scope": "Whole native selected-source content on both mattes, all9 selected poses plus adopted neutral at inherited maximum body reference 300.000000px across5both-matte pages, and all7 decoded discrete recipe rows actually viewed. Historical unselected sheet cells are not accepted by viewing their whole source. Physical UI zoom/density and real-time/interpolated/MP4 output not measured.",
  "observations": [
    "All 18 native light/dark source views, all five inherited-max300px light/dark pages, and all seven decoded discrete recipe rows were actually viewed for this fixed v002 handoff. Whole-source viewing of any historical unselected content does not adopt that content.",
    "Fresh present_left-v003 moves the near pectoral fin coherently forward from the gill and retains one pelvic and one anal fin downstream. The remnant extra fan at the old pectoral belly location in the rejected left-v002 is absent. This is a clear local improvement.",
    "Olive/pink spotted torso, brown contour and dot eye, cream muzzle, gill, dorsal and adipose fins, forked tail and fin ribs remain readable and connected on light and dark mattes. No detached parts, visible alpha cloud, clipped ends or duplicated part was observed in the selected originals.",
    "At the inherited maximum body reference300px, all ten states remain readable without reducing the declared maximum. New left does not introduce a body-size or floating-centre jump against the adopted neutral and surrounding gesture poses.",
    "Quiet blink is stable against neutral; greet-v003 has no detached left fragment; presentation_right is a coherent naturally reversed fish. Thinking/aha use restrained face and fin changes; species_a and species_b move the tail upward/downward.",
    "Celebration intentionally exposes the two existing anterior pectoral fans in addition to the two posterior lower fins. Their paired anterior anatomy differs from the rejected left pose sequential extra belly fan; no additional unexplained sequential lower fin was observed.",
    "Full frame dictionaries for neutral and the eight untouched selected poses, and the complete canonical_neutral dictionary, are exactly unchanged from registration-candidate-v001. Only present_left is replaced. Historical failed review-v001 and old original remain preserved.",
    "All seven discrete recipes were viewed with return-to-neutral neighbors. Contour, color and paper texture remain consistent enough for static/discrete stock; intended paper grain was not classified as dirty blotches."
  ],
  "cautions": [
    "Celebration deliberately shows two anterior pectoral fans; do not reinterpret this as the rejected left pose extra posterior belly fan.",
    "Small hand-drawn spot/contour differences remain in active gestures. This review covers native stills, inherited-max stills and decoded discrete sequences, not real-time compressed clips or finished production MP4.",
    "Physical UI zoom/density was not measured. Historical review-v001 remains a failed review of the prior handoff; this pass belongs only to fixed handoff-v002."
  ],
